Badminton footwork determines whether you can hit the ball steadily or not, practice badminton step for a while every day, so that I can play better on the court

Main Functions:
1. Adjust the "practice position", "number of groups" and "frequency" according to your own needs, and then start practicing;
2. Larger graphics will be displayed on iPad for easy viewing;
3. Open "Sound Effect" for a more immersive practice experience;
4. "Dynamic Speed" dynamically adjusts the speed based on your Settings to be closer to the real race;
5. Support multiple languages.

All data in the software is stored locally and no network requests are sent.

Any questions, please email yinxingdyx@163.com

We live in an era where we read texts, look at images, watch videos on computer and smartphone screens, which leads to eye strain and possible age related eye disorders.

We all know the importance of being healthy by doing regular workouts and staying active. The same could be said of your eyes, they also need regular workouts just like the rest of our body.


BLAEBERRY FEATURES:

    • Ophthalmologists recommended set of workouts;
    • Smart haptics workouts assistance;
    • Visual workouts assistance;
    • Voice workouts assistance;
    • Interaction with Health App.

IMPORTANT: 

    • Please consult your ophthalmologist before using the app;
    • Blaeberry reads and writes records to the Health App for proper displaying of the workouts statistics.

